# SAD does not require OpenSID or a MySQL database.
# The GitHub Pages frontend is static and currently configures the Supabase URL
# and publishable key in preview/index.html. Static GitHub Pages cannot read this file.
# Never place service_role keys, database passwords, HMAC secrets, or other private
# integration secrets in this file or in browser code. Store server-side secrets in
# the corresponding Supabase Edge Function secret settings.
